OL,2,V55555555CVICARAGE RAPE THUGS
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5C'HIGH ON DRUGS'
OL,5, The vicar whose home was the scene of a
OL,6, horrific rape in Ealing, West London,
OL,7, thinks the attackers were high on drugs
OL,9, He and another man had their skulls
OL,10, fractured in a savage beating and a
OL,11, young woman was raped by one thug and
OL,12, sexually assaulted by two others.
OL,14, The vicar has told friends that the
OL,15, attitude of the two younger thugs was
OL,16, so wild and aggressive that he thought
OL,17, they must have taken drugs.
OL,19, Police have reported a huge public
OL,20, response to their appeal for
OL,21, information.
