OL,2,V55555555CDETECTIVE STABBED
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CIN DRUGS RAID
OL,5, A young detective is recovering from a
OL,6, stab wound in the neck after a drugs
OL,7, raid in South London.
OL,9, Scotland Yard said the officer, aged
OL,10, 26, needed stitches but was later
OL,11, allowed home from hospital.
OL,13, Three men were being interviewed by
OL,14, officers from the Yard's central drugs
OL,15, squad after heroin worth #125,000 was
OL,16, seized.
OL,18, It is not known exactly where the raid
OL,19, took place.
