OL,2,V55555555CMARCOS FORTUNE IN
OL,3,Vu5u5u5u5CCARDBOARD BOXES
OL,5, Ousted Philippine president Ferdinand
OL,6, Marcos and his accomplices brought a
OL,7, fortune out of the country in cardboard
OL,8, boxes, US customs officials have said.
OL,10, The officials said the president's
OL,11, party had arrived in Hawaii with about
OL,12, #1m worth of Philippines pesos and
OL,13, other priceless possessions.
OL,15, Mr Marcos tried to block disclosure of
OL,16, the amount but a federal judge in
OL,17, Honolulu turned down his request.
OL,19, The Central Bank of the Philippines
OL,20, has filed a suit for the return of the
OL,21, money.
